      * RPG II file operations: CHAIN, READ, READE, SETLL (FREE-08)
     H
     FCUSTMAS IF         80  6AI     1 DISK
     FDEMAND1 ID         100            DISK
     FNOLAYT  ID         100            DISK
     FREPORT1 O         132            PRINTER
     ICUSTMAS AA
     I                                        1   60CUSTNO
     I                                        7  26 NAME
     IDEMAND1 BB
     I                                        1  10 DMD1
      * CHAIN with no-record indicator
     C           CUSTNO    CHAINCUSTMAS              90
      * SETLL and READE with end of file indicator
     C           CUSTNO    SETLLCUSTMAS
     C           CUSTNO    READECUSTMAS                  91
      * READ with error and end of file indicators
     C                     READ DEMAND1                9293
      * READ with no indicators
     C                     READ DEMAND1
      * Not converted
     C           CUSTNO    CHAINNOFILE               90
     C                     READ NOLAYT                   91
     C                     READ REPORT1
     C           CUSTNO    CHAINCUSTMAS                94
